# Optional. Enables AI features: exercise-name matching during history import
# (/api/match-exercises), Ask your history (/api/ask), program import (/api/extract-program)
# and Bend the week (/api/adapt-week).
# Without it, history import still works with code matches only, and the other features
# offer scripted examples.
# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Never commit .env.local.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional. Which Claude model the AI features use. Defaults to claude-haiku-5-5,
# the low-cost model. Set claude-opus-5-5 for the strongest (and priciest).
ANTHROPIC_MODEL=
